{
 "duration": 27.01,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Day three of Jake's park road trip, a storm closed the trail he had driven nine hours to hike.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 5.93
  },
  {
   "text": "Every night after that was booked somewhere else, so he had to drive on without it.",
   "start": 6.23,
   "end": 10.537
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 10.937,
   "end": 11.864
  },
  {
   "text": "Plan one loose day every few days, with no booking you can't move.",
   "start": 12.214,
   "end": 15.975
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep a rainy-day plan for each park, like a visitor center or a scenic drive,",
   "start": 16.225,
   "end": 21.056
  },
  {
   "text": "and check the park's alerts on nps.gov each morning.",
   "start": 21.206,
   "end": 24.774
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this while you plan.",
   "start": 25.474,
   "end": 26.81
  }
 ],
